# HuggingFace download manifest for:  ./download-models.sh --all
# Copy to models.list (gitignored) and adjust.
#
# Format (pipe-separated):   repo_id | path_in_repo | comfy_subdir
#   - comfy_subdir is relative to $COMFY_DIR/models/
#   - use "." when path_in_repo already carries the right folder: Comfy-Org's
#     repo layout (diffusion_models/, text_encoders/, vae/) is exactly
#     ComfyUI's, so those files place themselves.
#
# Everything here was verified against the HF API and loaded on Gertrude on
# 2026-09-24. Repo ids quoted in blog posts did not check out.
#
# --- Qwen-Image-2.1 (uncensored), measured 8555-9195 MiB peak --------------
# Safetensors, NOT a GGUF: ComfyUI-GGUF cannot load this model at all (the
# unsloth GGUFs carry no general.architecture and its detect_arch has no
# Qwen-Image entry). Despite the repo name, abenzerps also publishes
# safetensors, and its int8_convrot build is byte-for-byte the same size and
# format as Comfy-Org's -- a drop-in with no config change. Measured against
# the Comfy-Org original on 2026-09-26: no difference in time or VRAM that
# survives the run-to-run spread (see README).
abenzerps/Qwen-Image-2.1-Uncensored-GGUF | qwen-image-2.1-UC-int8_convrot.safetensors | diffusion_models
#
# The original, if the uncensored variant is not wanted:
# Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors | .
#
# Text encoder, 8.71 GB. With --lowvram it is streamed rather than resident, so
# this does not have to fit alongside the model.
Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors | .
#
# VAE, 0.63 GB
Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors | .
#
# --- Alternatives, untested here -------------------------------------------
# Smaller encoder (5.88 GB), if RAM gets tight:
# Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_w4a8.safetensors | .
# Reference-quality model (13.25 GB) — does NOT fit 12 GB:
# Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors | .
# Prompt-enhancing encoders for text-to-image / image-to-image (8.82 GB each):
# Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_qwen_image_2.1_pe_t2i.int8_convrot.safetensors | .
# Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1 | text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_qwen_image_2.1_pe_i2i.int8_convrot.safetensors | .
